## Agent tools

`{{ package_name }}.tools` registers `evaluate_signal`, `backtest_signal`, `walk_forward_signal`,
and `render_report` for a Quant-Agent-OS `Platform` or MCP server. The research tools read the
data and parameters in `config.toml` (or the file `{{ package_name | upper }}_CONFIG` names): a
caller picks a signal and a few parameters, never prices or file paths. They return metrics
without series and write nothing.{% if 'data-database' in components and db_kind == 'postgres' %} They declare `network`, because the database is across the network, so each
call needs an operator's approval.{% endif %}
